!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: prostate cancer cell line
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: none
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = 22Rv1 cells were treated with 20 µM Enzalutamide or DMSO for one week.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = 22Rv1 cells were cultured in RPMI-1640 medium (Sigma-Aldrich) contained 10% fetal bovine serum (Atlanta Biologicals, GA, USA), 100 U/ml of penicillin and 100 μg/ml streptomycin.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The genomic DNA was extracted with a DNeasy Blood & Tissue Kit (Qiagene).Total RNA was purified using an RNeasy Mini kit (Qiagene)
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = libraries were prepared for sequencing using standard Illumina protocols
!Sample_description = CRISPR-22Rv1-bsl
!Sample_description = paired-end but just used R1
!Sample_data_processing = CRISPR screen sequenced reads were mapped to sgRNA kinome library
!Sample_data_processing = sgRNA counts and gene beta score and FDR were calculated by MAGeCK v0.5.8
!Sample_data_processing = RNA-seq reads were mapped to human reference genome (GRCh38p12) via HISAT2 v2.1.0
!Sample_data_processing = The raw read counts on genes were derived by featureCounts from the subread package v1.5.1 in unstranded mode, based on Ensembl gene annotation release 92.
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: GRCh38p12
